\section*{Week 16: Full System Integration Summary}

\subsection*{Planned Deliverables (from thesis plan)}

\begin{itemize}
    \item Integrate all contracts
    \item Create end-to-end test scenarios
    \item Deploy the complete system to the local testnet
    \item Begin preliminary performance logging
\end{itemize}

\subsection*{What Was Built}

\subsubsection*{1. Multi-Layer Test Suite}

A comprehensive 3-layer test architecture was implemented:

\textbf{Layer 1: Unit Tests (23 tests)}

Location: pallets/content-rights/src/tests.rs + pallets/content-rights/src/mock.rs
\begin{itemize}
    \item Mock runtime with pallet-nfts + pallet-content-rights
    \item Tests for all extrinsics: register, subscribe, renew, PPV, transfer, check\_access
    \item Error path coverage (unauthorized, expired, not found)
\end{itemize}

\textbf{Layer 2: XCM Simulator Integration Tests}

Location: xcm-simulator-tests/
\begin{itemize}
    \item Simulates relay chain + 2 parachains
    \item Tests cross-chain subscription, renewal, PPV, ownership transfer
    \item Verifies XCM message construction and execution
    \item No actual network required
\end{itemize}

Relevant commit: adcacc4

\textbf{Layer 3: Zombienet E2E Tests}

Location: tests/xcm-e2e/
\begin{itemize}
    \item Live multi-chain tests against running Zombienet
    \item Tests the full pipeline: fund sovereign accounts $\rightarrow$ send XCM $\rightarrow$ verify state changes
    \item Covers: cross-chain subscribe, renew, PPV, ownership transfer
    \item Uses polkadot-js API for direct chain interaction
\end{itemize}

Relevant commits:
\begin{itemize}
    \item 7b61e08 --- Zombienet XCM E2E tests (Layer 3)
    \item a754117 --- E2E tests for all cross-chain XCM operations
\end{itemize}

\subsubsection*{2. Full System Deployment}

The complete system runs on a 4-chain Zombienet topology:

\begin{verbatim}
Rococo Relay Chain (alice, bob)
+-- Bridge Hub (para 1013) -- Snowbridge beacon client, message routing
+-- AssetHub (para 1000) -- Ether foreign asset, reserve transfers
+-- Content Rights (para 100) -- pallet-content-rights, pallet-nfts,
                                  pallet-revive
        ^
    Ethereum (Geth + Lodestar)
        ^
    Gateway contracts (GatewayProxy, BeefyClient, etc.)
\end{verbatim}

\textbf{HRMP channels:}
\begin{itemize}
    \item Bridge Hub (1013) $\leftrightarrow$ AssetHub (1000)
    \item AssetHub (1000) $\leftrightarrow$ Content Rights (100)
\end{itemize}

