\subsubsection*{4. Performance Logging}

Preliminary performance data collected:
\begin{itemize}
    \item XCM fees: \textasciitilde{}75--100B tokens per cross-chain operation (due to BlockRatioFee proof\_size scaling)
    \item Beacon finalization time: \textasciitilde{}39 minutes with 8 validators on mainnet preset
    \item Local testnet block time: 12s (relay), 12s (parachains)
\end{itemize}

